{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19117","headline":"洛中詶福建陈判官见赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中詶福建陈判官见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潦倒声名拥肿材，一生多故苦邅回。\n南宫旧籍遥相管，东洛闲门昼未开。\n静对道流论药石，偶逢词客与琼瑰。\n怪君近日文锋利，新向延平看劒来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}